{"id":723,"date":"2012-02-09T12:08:44","date_gmt":"2012-02-09T12:08:44","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=723"},"modified":"2015-04-24T23:22:39","modified_gmt":"2015-04-24T22:22:39","slug":"mais-qui-ne-connait-pas-le-ne555","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2012\/02\/09\/mais-qui-ne-connait-pas-le-ne555\/","title":{"rendered":"Mais qui ne conna\u00eet pas le NE555"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Quel \u00e9lectronicien ne conna\u00eet pas le fameux circuit NE555. Cela vous rappelle certainement vos premiers montages. Savez-vous qu&rsquo;il\u00a0a \u00e9t\u00e9 cr\u00e9\u00e9 en <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>1970<\/strong><\/span> par\u00a0<a title=\"Hans R. Camenzind\" href=\"http:\/\/fr.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Hans_R._Camenzind\">Hans R. Camenzind<\/a>\u00a0et commercialis\u00e9 en <strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">1971<\/span><\/strong> par\u00a0<a title=\"Signetics\" href=\"http:\/\/fr.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Signetics\">Signetics<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2012\/02\/NE555.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-724\" title=\"NE555\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2012\/02\/NE555.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"112\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2012\/02\/NE555.jpg 151w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2012\/02\/NE555-150x112.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 151px) 100vw, 151px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>H\u00e9 bien je viens d&rsquo;apprendre que\u00a0Diodes Incorporated annonce le lancement d\u2019une famille de circuits timers 555 bas co\u00fbts.<\/p>\n<p>C&rsquo;est quand m\u00eame formidable que 40 ans apr\u00e8s son invention, ce circuit est encore produit \u00e0\u00a0plusieurs centaines de millions d\u2019unit\u00e9s chaque ann\u00e9e, le 555 est encore largement utilis\u00e9 et reste aujourd\u2019hui encore un choix \u00e9vident dans une multitude d\u2019applications telles que timers de pr\u00e9cision, oscillateurs, g\u00e9n\u00e9rateurs d\u2019impulsions, etc.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Quel \u00e9lectronicien ne conna\u00eet pas le fameux circuit NE555. Cela vous rappelle certainement vos premiers montages. Savez-vous qu&rsquo;il\u00a0a \u00e9t\u00e9 cr\u00e9\u00e9<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[1],"class_list":["post-723","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub","tag-non-classe"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/723","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/4"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=723"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/723\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1710,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/723\/revisions\/1710"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=723"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=723"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=723"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}